Module Std.Debug

== Std.Debug (canon r3.63, OpenSpec change debug-assert).
==
==   Assert(Condition Bool)
==   Assert(Condition Bool, Message String)
==
== Assert is a compiler intrinsic, visible only in a program that writes
== `Use Std.Debug`. When the condition is false the program stops at once with
== "Inox runtime error: assertion failed" (and ": Message" when one is given)
== and exit status 70, like an overflow (CANON-19): no handler catches it and
== no ensure runs. It is never compiled out.
